# Tailwind v4 class syntax

This client uses **Tailwind CSS v4**. Apply the language server’s suggested rewrite instead of leaving a warning.

## Important modifier — suffix, not prefix

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
className="!rounded-none lg:!hidden"

// ✅ GOOD
className="rounded-none! lg:hidden!"
```

## CSS variables — parentheses, not `[var(--…)]`

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
className="text-[var(--fms-ink)] border-[var(--fms-border)]"

// ✅ GOOD
className="text-(--fms-ink) border-(--fms-border)"
```

Keep `[…]` for values that are not a bare CSS variable (`color-mix(…)`, calc, etc.).

## Prefer the suggested scale over equivalent arbitrary values

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
className="w-[16.5rem] lg:pl-[18rem]"

// ✅ GOOD
className="w-66 lg:pl-72"
```

Use arbitrary values only when there is no matching utility.
